{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Hide Recording Pill:** Completely hides the red screen recording indicator in the status bar.\n- **Intact Layout:** Prevents the clock and status bar elements from shifting or misaligning during screen recording.\n- **Compatibility:** Works smoothly on jailbreak environments.",
"useSpacing": false,
